WEBVTT

00:07:28.940 --> 00:07:31.602
and walk away without paying for it.

00:07:32.170 --> 00:07:37.828
We have the resources and the technology
to solve climate change.

00:07:37.852 --> 00:07:40.661
Together, we can save the trees

00:07:40.685 --> 00:07:42.575
and each other.

00:07:43.360 --> 00:07:44.763
Thank you.